<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1a1a2e; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f5f5f5; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); padding: 32px 40px; color: #fff; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
    .body { padding: 32px 40px; }
    .body p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: #374151; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #6366f1; color: #fff !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; margin: 8px 0 24px; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 40px; background: #f9fafb; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 13px; color: #9ca3af; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>You're invited! 🎉</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p><strong><%= @inviter.name || @inviter.email %></strong> has invited you to join <strong><%= @household.name %></strong> on OpenFinance as a <strong><%= @invitation.role %></strong>.</p>
      <p>OpenFinance is a collaborative personal finance app where you can track spending, manage budgets, and monitor your financial goals together.</p>
      <a href="<%= @accept_url %>" class="btn">Accept Invitation</a>
      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;">This invitation expires on <%= @invitation.expires_at.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
